Error [jet.IrreversibleEffectInTransaction]: `notify` has the `Net` effect, which can't be rolled back inside a `#Transact` block
  --> Tests/UI/sync_mutation_calls_net.jet:17:18
    |
 17 |         _status: notify("https://hooks.example.com/done")
    |                  ^^^^^^
 Why: A `#Transact` block undoes its work on a `?`-failure; a network, file, or subprocess effect (`Net`) leaves committed external state a rollback can't take back
 Fix: Move this call after the block, or register it with `<handle>.on_commit(fn() { … })` so it runs only on a clean commit
 Denial: transaction
 Call chain: notify
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0746
